  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — namely, the maximum magnitude outcome and its probability — is not considered by the individual. The individual does not reference the 2500 vs. 2400 Euro outcomes or their respective probabilities in any analytical or comparative way. The justification provided is absent of any rule-based reasoning involving weighted maximum outcomes. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The verbal report shows no indication of applying the rule of weighting the maximum magnitude outcome by probability. The final assessment is that the decision reason was not used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
